flowchart TD
    %% =========================
    %% BioAnalyzer System Guide
    %% =========================

    U[User / Curator]
    CLI[BioAnalyzer CLI<br/>scripts/cli.py]
    FILES[Input Files<br/>txt/csv/xls/xlsx]
    API[FastAPI Backend<br/>app/api]
    ORCH[Agent Orchestrator<br/>app/services/agent_orchestrator.py]
    RET[Data Retrieval<br/>PubMed + Web Scraper]
    RAG[RAG + Embeddings<br/>Vector Store Service]
    LLM[LLM Inference<br/>Gemini/OpenAI via config]
    VAL[Field Extraction + Validation<br/>6 BugSigDB fields]
    OUT[Results Formatter<br/>table/json/csv/xml]
    RES[results.csv / JSON / terminal output]
    DOCKER[Docker Compose<br/>bioanalyzer-package + redis]
    ENV[.env + Settings]
    HEALTH[/health + status checks]

    %% User interaction
    U -->|BioAnalyzer build/start/status/stop| CLI
    U -->|BioAnalyzer analyze --file ...| CLI
    U -->|BioAnalyzer analyze <pmid>| CLI
    U -->|BioAnalyzer analyze-url <url>| CLI
    U -->|BioAnalyzer retrieve <pmid>| CLI
    U -->|BioAnalyzer qa ...| CLI

    %% Runtime setup
    CLI -->|loads| ENV
    CLI -->|starts/checks| DOCKER
    DOCKER --> API
    CLI --> HEALTH
    HEALTH --> API

    %% Analysis pipeline
    CLI -->|submit request| API
    CLI -->|read PMIDs from| FILES
    FILES --> CLI

    API --> ORCH
    ORCH --> RET
    RET -->|paper text + metadata| ORCH

    ORCH --> RAG
    RAG --> LLM
    LLM --> RAG
    RAG --> ORCH

    ORCH --> VAL
    VAL -->|host_species, body_site, condition,<br/>sequencing_type, taxa_level, sample_size| API

    API --> OUT
    OUT --> CLI
    CLI --> RES
    RES --> U
